{
  "bookId": "hero-213204",
  "id": "bond-27520",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27520001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "真是难以想象，这是主人送给我的礼物？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "原来如此，算是报酬吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "什，什么报酬？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "当然是帮你念书的报酬。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可不记得我有听过那种东西！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "你当然没听过，因为我根本没念给你听啊，这算是预支的，预支的对吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "那么，还请主人为了让我有机会偿还这笔债务，每天晚上入睡前都来找我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可以问下是听什么书吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "是会让主人兴奋的书~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我应该不至于因为那种书兴奋。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "诶，我可还没说是什么书哟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "反正还请主人期待就是了！说好了，绝对，一定要来，不能错过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "不然下次我会跑到主人床边去大声念那种书的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27520015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我知道了，还请饶过我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
